[{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0066","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0066.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0863","title":"Microsoft Windows 错误报告特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 错误报告 (WER) 服务在处理错误报告文件时存在 DACL（自主访问控制列表）配置缺陷，导致低权限本地用户可通过构造恶意错误报告文件，利用 WER 服务以 SYSTEM 权限写入任意文件，进而实现本地权限提升。该漏洞影响 Windows x86/x64 多个版本（含 Windows 10/Server 2016/2019 等），CVSS 3.1 评分 7.8 (HIGH)，攻击向量为本地 (AV:L)，攻击复杂度低 (AC:L)，需低权限 (PR:L)，无需用户交互 (UI:N)，机密性/完整性/可用性均高影响 (C:H/I:H/A:H)。攻击者仅需本地普通用户权限，即可利用 WER 处理错误报告时的 DACL 缺陷写入任意文件实现提权至 SYSTEM 权限。该漏洞已被列入 CISA 已知被利用漏洞目录 (KEV)，ExploitDB (EDB-46917) 及多个 GitHub 仓库均有公开 PoC/EXP 代码，Microsoft 已于 2019 年 5 月补丁周二发布修复补丁。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0863"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-05-16T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:09:03Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft Windows 2020 年 2 月安全更新 (KB4522osocial)，或通过 Windows Update 自动更新以修复错误报告服务 DAC 权限配置。如无法立即打补丁，可临时停止错误报告服务并禁止目标主机访问互联网以缓解风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153008/Angry-Polar-Bear-2-Microsoft-Windows-Error-Reporting-Local-Privilege-Escalation.html","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0863","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0863","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46917","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0863.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2019-0863/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2019-0863/README_EN.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5586dd7f238e688df5e045b93ec7484d63fd140a/2019/0xxx/CVE-2019-0863.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-0863.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-0863.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-0863.md","https://github.com/hermit-hacker/OSCP-Study-Notes/blob/6c2587a4c4df26b2e9ad7b43ef299908055e5313/PrivEsc/Windows/Watson/Watson/Msrc/CVE-2019-0863.cs","https://github.com/wonderkun/crawler/blob/281e1d1564e073bd4c1322f63767c0f4fbfcf5eb/www.anquanke.com/Windows Error Reporting 0day漏洞分析（CVE-2019-0863）.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/README.md","https://github.com/Al1ex/WindowsElevation"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0066.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0011","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0011.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0708","title":"Microsoft Windows 远程桌面服务 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Windows 远程桌面服务（RDP）内核驱动 termdd.sys 存在释放后使用（Use-After-Free，CWE-416）漏洞，被称为 \"BlueKeep\"。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向开放 3389 端口的目标系统发送精心构造的 RDP 协议请求，触发内核内存使用后释放漏洞，导致远程代码执行（RCE），且无需用户交互、无需认证即可在 SYSTEM 权限下执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Windows 7、Windows Server 2008 R2 等未打补丁的旧版本 Windows 系统，具备蠕虫传播特性（类似 WannaCry），CVSS 3.1 评分 9.8（CRITICAL），属于极高危远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可利用公开 PoC（如 EternalBlue 风格的 Metasploit 模块、ExploitDB 47683 等）实现无文件落地的内核级代码执行。Microsoft 已于 2019 年 5 月发布安全更新（KB4499180 等）修复该漏洞，并罕见地为已停止支持的 Windows XP/Server 2003 发布补丁。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0708"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-05-16T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:44Z","remediation":"立即安装微软 2019 年 5 月安全更新：Windows 7 SP1/Server 2008 R2 安装 KB4499164/KB4499175，Server 2008 安装 KB4499149/KB4499180，XP/Server 2003 安装 KB4500331。启用 RDP 网络级身份验证（NLA）：运行 gpedit.msc → 计算机配置 → 管理模板 → Windows 组件 → 远程桌面服务 → 远程桌面会话主机 → 安全 → 要求用户使用网络级身份验证。防火墙层面封锁 3389 端口对公网开放，仅允许可信 IP 访问。非必要情况下禁用远程桌面服务。启用网络级身份验证（NLA）可作为临时缓解措施阻断未认证攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-30T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153133/Microsoft-Windows-Remote-Desktop-BlueKeep-Denial-Of-Service.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153627/Microsoft-Windows-RDP-BlueKeep-Denial-Of-Service.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154579/BlueKeep-RDP-Remote-Windows-Kernel-Use-After-Free.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155389/Microsoft-Windows-7-x86-BlueKeep-RDP-Use-After-Free.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162960/Microsoft-RDP-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.huawei.com/en/psirt/security-advisories/huawei-sa-20190529-01-windows-en","http://www.huawei.com/en/psirt/security-notices/huawei-sn-20190515-01-windows-en","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-166360.pdf","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-406175.pdf","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-433987.pdf","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-616199.pdf","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-832947.pdf","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/pdf/ssa-932041.pdf","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2019-0708","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-0708","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47683","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-0708.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b3697bfa0e74d327e178cbbc4c3c4d390b71eef/2019/CVE-2019-0708.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/fc9722130a529f009f2a36114f777e1872532eca/data/by-cve/CVE-2019-0708.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-8561.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2018/CVE-2018-0708.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/b349e2ac98435c78e6eec698cf95df82dacb0ca1/2019/CVE-2019-12489.md","https://github.com/eastmountyxz/SystemSecurity-ReverseAnalysis/blob/b5d141792e953e6b33196b4f3d0a5c4745a032fe/08.CVE-2019-0708/README.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-0708.md","https://github.com/straightblast/My-PoC-Exploits/blob/781c953ee10d3ab7e116707e774df5e7289aaeee/CVE-2019-0708.py","https://github.com/blaCCkHatHacEEkr/PENTESTING-BIBLE/blob/c458e814010ae369f21cf85e6babcc91722a2650/README.md","https://github.com/Ekultek/BlueKeep","https://github.com/robertdavidgraham/rdpscan","https://github.com/n1xbyte/CVE-2019-0708","https://github.com/k8gege/CVE-2019-0708","https://github.com/algo7/bluekeep_CVE-2019-0708_poc_to_exploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0011.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0131","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0131.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-1821","title":"Cisco Prime Infrastructure Software和Cisco Evolved Programmable Network Manager 输入验证错误漏洞","description":"Cisco Prime Infrastructure（PI）和 Cisco Evolved Programmable Network（EPN）Manager 的基于 Web 的管理界面存在输入验证错误漏洞。攻击者需先通过身份认证，随后上传恶意文件到管理界面，即可利用该漏洞在底层操作系统上以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Cisco Prime Infrastructure 及 EPN Manager 软件，CWE 分类为 CWE-20（输入验证不当），CVSS 评分为 8.8（高危）。利用条件为攻击者需具备对管理界面的网络可达性并持有合法认证凭据，成功利用后可获得系统最高权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-1821"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-16T01:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:29:23Z","remediation":"立即将 Cisco Prime Infrastructure 升级至 3.4.1、3.5 或 3.6 版本，或将 Cisco EPN Manager 升级至 3.0.1 版本。升级前从 Cisco Software Center 下载对应版本（路径：Browse all > Cloud and Systems Management > Network Management Solutions），确认设备内存充足且硬件配置受支持。若无法立即升级，将管理接口访问限制为仅可信 IP 网段，并禁用或隔离 Health Monitor 模块的上传功能以降低暴露面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153350/Cisco-Prime-Infrastructure-Health-Monitor-TarArchive-Directory-Traversal.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/108339","https://tools.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-20190515-pi-rce"