App Business iOS 版 v2.19.51 前版本、WhatsApp Windows Phone 版 v2.18.348 前版本及 WhatsApp Tizen 版 v2.18.15 前版本。CVSS 评分 9.8（CRITICAL），属于 CWE-122 和 CWE-787 类型，无需用户交互即可远程利用，危害极大。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-3568"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-05-14T20:29:03Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:35:14Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 WhatsApp 至安全版本：Android 版升级至 v2.19.134 或更高，Android Business 版升级至 v2.19.44 或更高，iOS 版升级至 v2.19.51 或更高，iOS Business 版升级至 v2.19.51 或更高，Windows Phone 版升级至 v2.18.348 或更高，Tizen 版升级至 v2.18.15 或更高。通过 Google Play、App Store 或官方渠道更新应用。若无法立即更新，建议暂停使用 WhatsApp 语音通话功能，避免接听来自未知号码的通话。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/108329","https://www.facebook.com/security/advisories/cve-2019-3568","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-3568","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-3568.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/0812ebe932b97710173c59d3d74959fb420956eb/2019/3xxx/CVE-2019-3568.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-3568.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-3568.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/CVE/data/2019/CVE-2019-3568.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2019/CVE-2019-3568.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/fe7f195231342e1e88104679c53c965e9a67ac35/nvdcve/CVE-2019-3568.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/b5070d3c2d6dc2fda079c163276abcda1c82b124/CVE-2019/CVE-2019-35xx/CVE-2019-3568.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-3568.md","https://github.com/fankh/vulnerability-poc/blob/bf83a006d6790e135a17faee5029d9308d3e3710/2019/CVE-2019-3568/README.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0047","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0047.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-11886","title":"WordPress WaspThemes Visual CSS Style Editor插件跨站请求伪造漏洞","description":"WordPress 的 WaspThemes Visual CSS Style Editor（又名 yellow-pencil-visual-theme-customizer）插件 7.2.1 版本之前存在跨站请求伪造（CSRF）漏洞。攻击者可利用 yp_option_update 接口的 CSRF 缺陷，结合 yp_remote_get 功能实现管理员权限获取。攻击者只需诱使已登录的管理员用户访问恶意构造的页面，即可在未经授权的情况下执行任意操作，包括修改站点配置、注入恶意代码等。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高，影响大量使用该插件的 WordPress 站点。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-11886"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-13T05:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:13:48Z","remediation":"立即将 WordPress 的 WaspThemes Visual CSS Style Editor（yellow-pencil-visual-theme-customizer）插件升级至 7.2.1 或更高版本。该版本已修复 yp_option_update CSRF 漏洞，可防止攻击者通过伪造请求利用 yp_remote_get 获取管理员权限。如无法立即升级，可暂时禁用该插件作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://wordpress.org/plugins/yellow-pencil-visual-theme-customizer/#developers","https://wpvulndb.com/vulnerabilities/9256","https://www.pluginvulnerabilities.com/2019/04/09/recently-closed-visual-css-style-editor-wordpress-plugin-contains-privilege-escalation-vulnerability-that-leads-to-option-update-vulnerability/","https://www.wordfence.com/blog/2019/04/zero-day-vulnerability-in-yellow-pencil-visual-theme-customizer-exploited-in-the-wild/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-11886.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-11886.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-11886.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86965a1ef7a64a35a4bffc5193446981deb1b2f5/cves/2019/11xxx/CVE-2019-1188