s-plugin-team-paints-target-on-exploitable-settings-change-vulnerability-that-permits-persistent-xss-in-related-posts/","https://www.wordfence.com/blog/2019/04/yuzo-related-posts-zero-day-vulnerability-exploited-in-the-wild/","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-11869.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-11869.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/15bf95c7b4616c8551a2bd666d40a8a1a07282d6/2019/CVE-2019-11869.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/3d3e4ac5fc656462e5751cd66b39c577cd9a2341/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-11869.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/CVE-2019-11869.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-11869-3761.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-11869-3763.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-11869-3764.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2019-11869-3762.yaml","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/WordPress/CVE-2019-11869.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-11869/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2019-11869.py","https://github.com/gitrecon1455/CVE-2019-11869"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0046.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0208","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-11510","title":"Pulse Secure Pulse Connect Secure 任意文件读取漏洞","description":"Pulse Secure Pulse Connect Secure (PCS) 存在路径遍历漏洞，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标设备发送特制的 URI 请求，利用目录遍历技术读取服务器上的任意文件，包括系统配置文件、用户凭据、VPN 会话密钥等敏感信息。该漏洞影响 PCS 8.2R12.1 之前版本、8.3R7.1 之前版本及 9.0R3.4 之前版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。攻击无需任何认证即可远程触发，且已出现大规模在野利用。厂商 Pulse Secure 已发布安全更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2019-11510"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-05-08T17:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:13:04Z","remediation":"立即升级 Pulse Connect Secure 至以下安全版本：8.2R12.1、8.3R7.1 或 9.0R3.4 及以上。如无法立即升级，可在 Pulse Secure 设备上配置访问控制策略，限制外部 IP 对 /dana/ 路径的访问，并启用 Web Application Firewall 规则拦截包含 `../` 的 URI 请求作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154176/Pulse-Secure-SSL-VPN-8.1R15.1-8.2-8.3-9.0-Arbitrary-File-Disclosure.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154231/Pulse-Secure-SSL-VPN-File-Disclosure-NSE.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/108073","https://badpackets.net/over-14500-pulse-secure-vpn-endpoints-vulnerable-to-cve-2019-11510/","https://devco.re/blog/2019/09/02/attacking-ssl-vpn-part-3-the-golden-Pulse-Secure-ssl-vpn-rce-chain-with-Twitter-as-case-study/","https://i.blackhat.com/USA-19/Wednesday/us-19-Tsai-Infiltrating-Corporate-Intranet-Like-NSA.pdf","https://kb.pulsesecure.net/?atype=sa","https://kb.pulsesecure.net/articles/Pulse_Security_Advisories/SA44101/","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/ff5fa1837b6bd1b24d18a42faa75e165a4573dbe2d434910c15fd08a%40%3Cuser.guacamole.apache.org%3E","https://psirt.global.sonicwall.com/vuln-detail/SNWLID-2019-0010","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/927237","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-11510","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47297","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-11510.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2019/CVE-2019-11510.md","https://github.com/Mr-xn/Penetration_Testing_POC/blob/6602db50598d0ed3bff77588ae1140dbe71a025c/vuln_pocs