lse,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0045.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1209","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-3929","title":"Barco wePresent file_transfer.cgi 命令注入漏洞","description":"Crestron AM-100/101、Barco wePresent、Extron ShareLink、Teq AV IT WIPS710、SHARP PN-L703WA、Optoma WPS-Pro、Blackbox HD WPS、InFocus LiteShow3/4 等多款路由器产品均存在命令注入漏洞。攻击者可远程匿名利用 file_transfer.cgi HTTP 端点的漏洞，在未授权情况下执行任意系统命令并获得 root 权限。此严重漏洞影响多个路由器厂商和版本，可能危及网络设备安全并导致系统被完全掌控。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-3929"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-30T21:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:35:52Z","remediation":"建议立即升级所有受影响设备至厂商最新固件：Barco WiPG-1600W 升级至 2.4.1.19 或更高版本，Crestron AM-100/AM-101、Extron ShareLink 200/250、Teq WIPS710、Sharp PN-L703WA、Optoma WPS-Pro、Blackbox HD WPS、InFocus LiteShow3/4 登录各官网下载并安装最新固件。若暂无法升级，请将设备管理接口隔离在受管 VLAN，防火墙仅允许受信 IP 访问 80/443 端口，并在 Web 服务器层面禁用 file_transfer.cgi 端点，禁止未授权访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152715/Barco-AWIND-OEM-Presentation-Platform-Unauthenticated-Remote-Command-Injection.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155948/Barco-WePresent-file_transfer.cgi-Command-Injection.html","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46786/","https://www.tenable.com/security/research/tra-2019-20","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-3929","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47924","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-3929.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-3929.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2019/CVE-2019-3929.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2019/CVE-2019-3929.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272