://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152487/Zimbra-Collaboration-Autodiscover-Servlet-XXE-ProxyServlet-SSRF.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/153190/Zimbra-XML-Injection-Server-Side-Request-Forgery.html","http://www.rapid7.com/db/modules/exploit/linux/http/zimbra_xxe_rce","https://blog.tint0.com/2019/03/a-saga-of-code-executions-on-zimbra.html","https://blog.zimbra.com/2019/03/9826/","https://bugzilla.zimbra.com/show_bug.cgi?id=109127","https://wiki.zimbra.com/wiki/Security_Center","https://wiki.zimbra.com/wiki/Zimbra_Security_Advisories","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46693/","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-9621","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46967","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-9621.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-9621.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/c908bbff86d2944f8f8a39e75f549a966c642420/2019/CVE-2019-9621.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/e9f0fe7fa4f5c548bbd1a4d3b65d0f181021e664/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-9621.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/8491df4167cab37455be87043bbd4187ade74c40/cves/2019/9xxx/CVE-2019-9621.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6ff73fb4bb99974a2b535c179f337dd820550366/2019/9xxx/CVE-2019-9621.json","https://github.com/0x727/FingerprintHub/blob/5784554659c9500df8525e8db4f986630a56d8a1/plugins/zimbra/collaboration_server/CVE-2019-9621.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-9621.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-9621.md","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/Zimbra/（CVE-2019-9621）（CVE-2019-9670）Zimbra 远程代码执行漏洞.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/16f8cf2a3c129bb57f3727599f3730e6001c1186/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-9621.json","https://github.com/k8gege/ZimbraExploit"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1683.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-1683.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1683.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1168","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-2725","title":"Oracle WebLogic Server wls9-async 组件远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Oracle WebLogic Server 的 wls9-async 组件存在反序列化远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者无需认证即可通过 HTTP 协议向目标服务器发送精心构造的 SOAP 请求包，触发反序列化操作，从而在服务器端执行任意命令，完全控制目标系统。该漏洞影响 WebLogic 10.3.6.0.0 和 12.1.3.0.0 版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。Oracle 官方已发布安全补丁修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-2725"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-26T19:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:34:26Z","remediation":"立即升级 Oracle WebLogic Server 至 10.3.6.0.180116 或 12.1.3.0.190416 及以上版本。如无法升级，删除 _async 目录下的 wls9_async_response.war 和 wls9_async_request.war 文件并重启服务；或在 Web 应用防火墙（WAF）层面拦截包含 _async/ 路径的 HTTP 请求，同时禁用 Web 服务组件中不必要的异步通信功能。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152756/Oracle-Weblogic-Server-Deserialization-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/alert-cve-2019-2725-5466295.html","http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpujul2019-5072835.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/108074","https://support.f5.com/csp/article/K90059138","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46780/","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/alert-cve-2019-2725.html#AppendixFMW","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujan2020.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-2725","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46780","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-2725.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-2725.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/986b45a0ac2dd215b3a5515fba0cebac769043dd/2019/CVE-2019-2725.md","https://github.com/wgpsec/AboutSecurity/blob/f3c8574e6fa1f9c1cd5aeaba5a209af796107b34/Vuln/middleware/weblogic/CVE-2019-2725.md","https://github.com/boy-hack/airbug/blob/3d526a4e2061a13b3d8398fa7db6d1b640b93085/system/weblogic/cve-2019-2725.py","https://github.com/dr0op/WeblogicScan/blob/6d01c0bdb3cfeee959c74a342014206dbf9bf6f3/app/plugins/CVE-2019-2725.py","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-2729.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-2725.md","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-2725/vultarget/README.md","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2017/CVE-2017-3506.md","https://github.com/vuldb/cyber_threat_intelligence/blob/6a5017307e035c2b54c7afbe3bd8582497eafa96/campaigns/c/CVE-2019-2725/README.md","https://github.com/0xn0ne/weblogicScanner","https://github.com/shack2/javaserializetools","https://github.com/lufeirider/CVE-2019-2725","https://github.com/black-mirror/Weblogic","https://github.com/pimps/CVE-2019-2725"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1168.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-1168.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0209","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0209.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-11539","title":"Pulse Secure Pulse Connect Secure VPN 任意命令执行漏洞","description":"Pulse Secure Pulse Connect Secure 及 Pulse Policy Secure 的管理员 Web 界面存在命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。未经充分授权的攻击者可通过已认证的管理员账户，向 Web 界面提交包含恶意操作系统命令的输入，从而在目标服务器上执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 Pulse Connect Secure 9.0RX（9.0R3.4 之前）、8.3RX（8.3R7.1 之前）、8.2RX（8.2R12.1 之前）、8.1RX（8.1R15.1 之前）以及 Pulse Policy Secure 9.0RX（9.0R3.2 之前）、5.4RX（5.4R7.1 之前）、5.3RX（5.3R12.1 之前）、5.2RX（5.2R12.1 之前）、5.1RX（5.1R15.1 之前）等多个版本。CVSS 评分为 7.2（高危），攻击者需具备管理员身份认证后方可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2019-11539"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-26T02:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:13:07Z","remediation":"立即升级 Pulse Connect Secure 至 9.0R3.4、8.3R7.1、8.2R12.1 或 8.1R15.1 及以上版本，或将 Pulse Policy Secure 升级至 9.0R3.2、5.4R7.1、5.3R12.1、5.2R12.1、5.1R15.1 及以上版本。升级前可临时限制管理界面访问来源 IP，并启用多因素认证以降低被利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-02T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/154376/Pulse-Secure-8.1R15.1-8.2-8.3-9.0-SSL-VPN-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155277/Pulse-Secure-VPN-Arbitrary-Command-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162092/Pulse-Secure-VPN-Arbitrary-Command-Execution.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/108073","https://devco.re/blog/2019/09/02/attacking-ssl-vpn-part-3-the-golden-Pulse-Secure-ssl-vpn-rce-chain-with-Twitter-as-case-study/","https://i.blackhat.com/USA-19/Wednesday/us-19-Tsai-Infiltrating-Corporate-Intranet-Like-NSA.pdf","https://kb.pulsesecure.net/articles/Pulse_Security_Advisories/SA44101","https://psirt.global.sonicwall.com/vuln-detail/SNWLID-2019-0010","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/927237","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-11539","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47700","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-11539.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/8b4078d62a74c93dc4c23d215ab5f6afbd5639cd/2019/CVE-2019-11539.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-11539.md","https://github.com/0xDezzy/CVE-2019-11539/blob/81c63eaad2848e033e64f614ab29df0f64bbc375/CVE-2019-11539.py","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-11539.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2019/CVE-2019-11539.md","https://github.com/bugbountywithmarco/bugbounty-disclosed-reports/blob/b6c76d1437e08a0ef77b7fbed612791c71cc4aa5/reports/680480_Command_Injection_via_CVE-2019-11510_and_CVE-2019-11539.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2019/CVE-2019-11539.rules","https://github.com/0xT11/CVE-POC/blob/2b6f11c3712c0efb88ac3edeab3d0aafa1f7a090/2019/CVE-2019-11539.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2019/CVE-2019-11539.md","https://github.com/0xDezzy/CVE-2019-11539"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-0209.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1111","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1111.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-2616","title":"Oracle BI Publisher XML外部实体注入漏洞","description":"Oracle Fusion Middleware 的 BI Publisher（原 XML Publisher）组件存在 XML 外部实体注入（XXE）漏洞。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过 HTTP 协议向受影响版本（11.1.1.9.0、12.2.1.3.0、12.2.1.4.0）的 BI Publisher 发送特制的 XML 请求，利用 XML 解析器对外部实体的处理缺陷，实现未授权读取或修改服务器上的任意文件及内部数据。该漏洞影响范围可波及其他关联产品，攻击无需任何权限或用户交互，利用复杂度低，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高。Oracle 已在 2019 年 4 月关键补丁更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-2019-2616"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-23T19:32:51Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:34:13Z","remediation":"立即登录 My Oracle Support 下载并安装 Oracle Fusion Middleware 的 2019 年 4 月关键补丁更新（CPUApr2019）中针对 BI Publisher 的安全补丁。受影响版本 11.1.1.9.0 升级至 11.1.1.9.0 对应补丁级别，12.2.1.3.0 和 12.2.1.4.0 分别升级至对应 CPU 补丁版本。如无法立即打补丁，可在网络层面限制对 BI Publisher HTTP 服务的非授权访问，仅允许可信 IP 段访问，并禁用 XML 外部实体解析功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.oracle.com/technetwork/security-advisory/cpuapr2019-5072813.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-2616","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/46729","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-2616.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-2616.md","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/2c6b2e1482debf55f607b200837f63426669df52/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-2616.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-2616.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-2616-4101.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-2616-4102.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/cve-2019-2616-4103.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/reapoc/blob/699762e4c31d0183733f64313d8fc3be6470bd37/2019/CVE-2019-2616/poc/pocsploit/CVE-2019-2616.py","https://github.com/GhostTroops/scan4all/blob/fff03b51bf79c8993a46c1da766ec993e1102c47/config/51pwn/yaml/Oracle Fusion Middleware/CVE-2019-2616.yaml","https://github.com/cckuailong/pocsploit/blob/fe4a3154e59d2bebd55ccfdf62f4f7efb21b5a2a/modules/cves/2019/CVE-2019-2616.py","https://github.com/SleepingBag945/dddd/blob/4c428a7c171275bfbb5fa72c2fb4bd7b48f4ff4a/common/config/pocs/CVE-2019-2616.yaml"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2019/POC-AVE-2019-1111.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2019/EXP-AVE-2019-1111.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1111.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-1206","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-1206.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-3398","title":"Confluence downloadallattachments 目录遍历漏洞 漏洞","description":"The task asks to generate the [description] field for CVE-2019-3398. Output only the description content between <value> tags.<value>Atlassian Confluence Server 和 Data Center 的 downloadallattachments 组件存在目录遍历漏洞。由于该组件对下载附件的文件路径过滤不严，远程攻击者可在拥有向页面或博客添加附件权限、创建空间权限，或拥有空间管理员权限的情况下，通过构造包含特殊路径序列的请求利用该漏洞，将文件写入服务器的任意目录，进而可能导致远程代码执行，使攻击者完全控制服务器。该漏洞影响 Confluence 从 2.0.0 到 6.15.2 的多个版本分支（6.6.x 至 6.15.x）。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 8.8，危害等级高危，且已被纳入 CISA KEV 已知被利用漏洞目录，实际攻击风险较高。Atlassian 已在 6.6.13、6.12.4、6.13.4、6.14.3 和 6.15.3 及","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2019-3398"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2019-04-18T18:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:35:05Z","remediation":"建议立即升级 Confluence Server 或 Data Center 至官方修复版本（6.6.x 升级至 6.6.13，6.12.x 升级至 6.12.4，6.13.x 升级至 6.13.4，6.14.x 升级至 6.14.3，6.15.x 升级至 6.15.2 及更高版本），可从 Atlassian 官方下载中心获取安装包并执行就地升级。升级前请备份 data 目录与数据库。若无法立即升级，作为缓解措施应严格收敛权限，仅向可信用户授予附件上传及空间管理权限，并通过反向代理或防火墙对下载附件相关接口（downloadallattachments）实施访问控制，阻断不可信来源。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-03T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/152616/Confluence-Server-Data-Center-Path-Traversal.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155235/Atlassian-Confluence-6.15.1-Directory-Traversal.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/155245/Atlassian-Confluence-6.15.1-Directory-Traversal.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/108067","https://jira.atlassian.com/browse/CONFSERVER-58102","https://seclists.org/bugtraq/2019/Apr/33","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2019-3398","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/47621","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2019/CVE-2019-3398.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/7d40e7d94b41c478b4d1a654c7bc3bcf34fa7beb/2019/CVE-2019-3398.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/57432302d64f9bc08597d61c88fc5f900569476d/2019/CVE-2019-3398.json","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/high/CVE-2019-3398.yaml","https://github.com/0x783kb/Threat-Analysis-Handbook/blob/c35524f11e7cd0fdd97596792dc2883cedbfa69b/Web/long time/T1190-CVE-2019-3398-Confluence路径穿越漏洞.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/74a17114d313d1fcf11590910ec4d27e95394ac2/2019/CVE-2019-3398.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2019-3398.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2019/CVE-2019-3398.md","https://github.com/satan1a/TheRoadOfSO/blob/a041e5eae58e510e2749156e9f4b100d4749cbcc/docs/0x2_ 威胁狩猎/2x3_初始访问/T1190-CVE-2019-3398-Confluence路径穿越漏洞.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2019/CVE-2019-3398.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8a257d250bdb59b542a188d62ddae45e6eb5d3f2/SSVC/data/2019/CVE-2019-3398.json","https://github.com/superevr/cve-2019-3398","https://github.com/132231g/CVE-2019-3398"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2019/AVE-2019-1206.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2019-0027","file_name":"2019/AVE-2019-0027.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2019-0232","title":"Apache Tomcat CGIServlet 远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Apache Tomcat 的 CGI Servlet 在 Windows 平台且 enableCmdLineArguments 启用时，由于 JRE 传递命令行参数到 Windows 的方式存在缺陷，导致远程代码执行漏洞。攻击者可通过向 CGI 脚本发送特制参数触发命令注入，实现任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 Tomcat 7.0.0~7.0.93、8.5.0~8.5.39、9.0.0.M1~9.0.17 版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。CGI Servlet 默认关闭，enableCmdLineArguments 在 9.0.x 默认关闭。Apache 已发布新版修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2019-0232"],"sources":["nuclei"],"published":"2019-04-15T15:29:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:08:02Z","remediation":"升级 Apache Tomcat 至 9.0.19 及以上、8.5.40 及以上或 7.0.94 及以上版本。如无法升级，在 conf/web.xml 中删除 CGI Servlet 定义或将其注释掉，并确保 catalina.properties 中 enableCmdLineArguments 参数保持默认关闭状态（false）。Windows 环境下切勿启用该参数。","status":"completed","collect